2026-10-15 03:20:46,259 DEBUG: AI Response: The term "lice" refers to young lice that infest human hair. These lice are a common household bug and can be particularly annoying and problematic for hairdressers and other personal care professionals. They are also known to cause hair loss and can be transmitted through close contact with an infested person or item. If you suspect that you or someone else has lice, it's important to take appropriate measures to remove them, as lice can be a health hazard and pose a risk to your personal and public health.
